# This repository is a Unity *package*, not a Unity project. The folders below belong to a project and only
# turn up here when the package is opened inside one — as a local `file:` dependency during development.

/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Generated by the IDE integration, never by hand.
*.csproj
*.sln
*.unityproj
*.user
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.suo
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Crash and profiler output.
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
*.stackdump

# macOS, Windows.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Do NOT ignore *.meta. Unity stores each asset's GUID there, and every reference in a consuming project
# resolves through it. A package that ships without them makes every installation invent its own GUIDs.
# `Documentation~` is exempt only because Unity ignores any folder ending in `~` and generates none for it.

# Working notes that are not part of the package: requirements and the plans that implement them. They live
# beside the ADRs so they are easy to read together, but only the ADRs are the record this repository keeps.
Documentation~/requirements/
